---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Forfactor" description="Forfactor is an Australian technology company building useful digital products for people and businesses.">
<section class="hero"><div class="shell hero-grid reveal"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Independent technology company · Australia</p><h1>We build technology that feels <em>useful.</em></h1><p class="lede">Forfactor creates focused digital products that help people connect, learn and run better businesses.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/products/">Explore our products <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Why Forfactor <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Forfactor product portfolio"><div class="visual-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="visual-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="visual-core"><span class="core-mark"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>FORFACTOR</small></div><div class="signal-card signal-one"><span class="signal-icon keenout-dot"></span><div><small>SOCIAL DISCOVERY</small><strong>Keenout</strong></div></div><div class="signal-card signal-two"><span class="signal-icon heela-dot"></span><div><small>BUSINESS AI</small><strong>Heela</strong></div></div><div class="signal-card signal-three"><span class="signal-icon pronovo-dot"></span><div><small>LEARNING</small><strong>Pronovo</strong></div></div></div></div><div class="shell hero-foot"><span>Products with a clear purpose</span><span>Designed and built in Australia</span><span>Made for the real world</span></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we build</p><div><h2>Products for life beyond the screen.</h2><p>We focus on clear human needs, then use thoughtful technology to make the experience simpler.</p></div></div><div class="product-grid"><ProductCard number="01 / SOCIAL" name="Keenout" description="Discover local events, meet people and make real-life plans." href="/products/keenout/" featured/><ProductCard number="02 / BUSINESS" name="Heela" description="An AI-powered phone receptionist platform for businesses." href="/products/heela/" status="In development"/><ProductCard number="03 / LEARNING" name="Pronovo" description="Accessible language learning built around consistent practice." href="/products/pronovo/"/></div></div></section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Our approach</p><div><h2>Technology should earn its place.</h2><p>We start with a real human need, remove the unnecessary, and build the smallest thing that can make a meaningful difference.</p></div></div><div class="principles"><div class="principle"><span class="principle-icon">◎</span><span class="eyebrow">01 · OUTCOMES</span><h3>Start with people</h3><p>We begin with the progress someone is trying to make—not the technology we want to use.</p></div><div class="principle"><span class="principle-icon">◇</span><span class="eyebrow">02 · CLARITY</span><h3>Make it obvious</h3><p>Thoughtful structure and plain language make powerful products feel simple.</p></div><div class="principle"><span class="principle-icon">↗</span><span class="eyebrow">03 · PROGRESS</span><h3>Build to improve</h3><p>We create reliable foundations, learn from use and make each release more useful.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section featured-section"><div class="shell featured-panel"><div class="featured-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Featured product</p><h2>More reasons to go out. More people to go with.</h2><p>Keenout turns “we should do something” into a real plan—helping people discover local events, connect through shared interests and meet in the real world.</p><a class="button" href="https://keenout.com.au">Discover Keenout <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="keenout-demo" aria-label="Illustration of Keenout event discovery"><div class="demo-head"><span>Near you</span><span>Saturday · Sydney</span></div><div class="event-card event-main"><div class="event-art"><span>LIVE</span><i></i></div><div class="event-info"><small>THIS WEEKEND</small><strong>Sunset Social Walk</strong><span>Bondi to Bronte · 4:30 pm</span><div class="attendees"><b>NK</b><b>AM</b><b>+8</b><small>people are keen</small></div></div></div><div class="mini-events"><span>Creative workshop</span><span>Social tennis</span><span>Sunday markets</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section tight"><div class="shell cta"><h2>Have something to discuss?</h2><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@forfactor.com">hello@forfactor.com ↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
